{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "每日清晨入壇，諸品經呪普回向畢，主經者起香讚，　大眾起立，同聲念"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "主經出琲，白云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "主歸位"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三念"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起經卷，卷經畢，念補〔鬧〕真言，舉讚，或唱字母竟，略回向云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後皆倣此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或拜行願品，或禮華嚴文，宣疏　起止竟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "竟"}
{"id": null, "n": "0374001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0374001", "type": "orig", "text": "鬧疑闕"}
